# .cursorrules — WeatherNow

## Stack
- Flutter (Dart) — Clean Architecture
- State: Riverpod (flutter_riverpod)
- Networking: Dio via DioClient
- Local storage: shared_preferences / hive
- Env: flutter_dotenv

## Layer Rules
- domain/ entities have NO fromJson/toJson and NO flutter imports
- data/ models extend or map to domain entities
- presentation/ only talks to domain via providers
- All API calls go through lib/core/network/dio_client.dart

## Code Style
- snake_case files, PascalCase classes
- Providers: AsyncNotifierProvider for async, NotifierProvider for sync
- Exceptions: use typed classes from lib/core/errors/exceptions.dart
- No hardcoded strings — use AppConstants

## Never
- Commit .env
- Import flutter in domain/
- Call HTTP directly from widgets
